# Start the backend first; change the port here if needed.
# Run individual requests with an HTTP client that supports .http files.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Welcome message: 200 with the backend welcome message
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### Liveness: 200 with status, service, version, and Cache-Control: no-store
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Headers-only liveness: 200 with no body and a new X-Request-ID
HEAD {{baseUrl}}/health

### API contract: 200 with the generated OpenAPI schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json
Accept: application/json

### Unknown route: 404 with a detail field and X-Request-ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/missing
Accept: application/json

### Unsupported health write: 405 with a detail field and X-Request-ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json
